{"id":"c261b0ab1c6bf486","group":"88","path":"88/88-prop-hyp-contains-arith.md","title":"HYP Contains Arithmetic Proposition","display":"prop-hyp-contains-arith — HYP Contains Arithmetic Proposition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-prop-hyp-contains-arith","aliases":["88-prop-hyp-contains-arith"],"display":"prop-hyp-contains-arith — HYP Contains Arithmetic Proposition","depends_on":["[[88-df-hyperarithmetical]]","[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-def]]","[[88-df-ordinal-notation]]","[[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties]]","[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[88-df-turing-jump]]","[[88-df-turing-reduction]]","[[88-thm-post-theorem]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-prop-hyp-contains-arith"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-prop-hyp-contains-arith</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-hyp-contains-arith — HYP Contains Arithmetic Proposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a8bec8cb4c1a4891\" href=\"?note=a8bec8cb4c1a4891\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical\">88-df-hyperarithmetical</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca39023cb294c484\" href=\"?note=ca39023cb294c484\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy\">88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6587ae27f7ed289f\" href=\"?note=6587ae27f7ed289f\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def\">88-df-hyperarithmetical-def</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b23177f17eeaa7a2\" href=\"?note=b23177f17eeaa7a2\" title=\"88-df-ordinal-notation\">88-df-ordinal-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"17e23d087321028e\" href=\"?note=17e23d087321028e\" title=\"88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties\">88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c78101abe1090034\" href=\"?note=c78101abe1090034\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4b6966788d04924e\" href=\"?note=4b6966788d04924e\" title=\"88-thm-post-theorem\">88-thm-post-theorem</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HYP}\">\\(\\mathrm{HYP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a8bec8cb4c1a4891\" href=\"?note=a8bec8cb4c1a4891\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical\">88-df-hyperarithmetical</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_a\">\\(H_a\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ca39023cb294c484\" href=\"?note=ca39023cb294c484\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy\">88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy</a>，其递归子句见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"6587ae27f7ed289f\" href=\"?note=6587ae27f7ed289f\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def\">88-df-hyperarithmetical-def</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{88}\">\\(\\mathcal O_{88}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b23177f17eeaa7a2\" href=\"?note=b23177f17eeaa7a2\" title=\"88-df-ordinal-notation\">88-df-ordinal-notation</a>，构造子性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"17e23d087321028e\" href=\"?note=17e23d087321028e\" title=\"88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties\">88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0\\)</span>（包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span>）见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"c78101abe1090034\" href=\"?note=c78101abe1090034\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset^{(n)}\">\\(\\emptyset^{(n)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a>；有限层的可归约刻画使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"4b6966788d04924e\" href=\"?note=4b6966788d04924e\" title=\"88-thm-post-theorem\">88-thm-post-theorem</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}hyp\\text{-}contains\\text{-}arith}\\vdash\n\\exists a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\n\\Bigl(a(0)=1\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(a(n+1)=2^{a(n)}\\land H_{a(n)}=\\emptyset^{(n)})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}hyp\\text{-}contains\\text{-}arith}\\vdash\n\\exists a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\n\\Bigl(a(0)=1\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(a(n+1)=2^{a(n)}\\land H_{a(n)}=\\emptyset^{(n)})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}hyp\\text{-}contains\\text{-}arith}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\Sigma_n^0\\cup\\Pi_n^0\\subseteq\\mathrm{HYP})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}hyp\\text{-}contains\\text{-}arith}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\Sigma_n^0\\cup\\Pi_n^0\\subseteq\\mathrm{HYP})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(0)=1\">\\(a(0)=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(n+1)=2^{a(n)}\">\\(a(n+1)=2^{a(n)}\\)</span> 作自然数递归，零与后继记号规则保证其值均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{88}\">\\(\\mathcal O_{88}\\)</span>。层级子句和有限跳跃定义归纳给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{a(n)}=\\emptyset^{(n)}\">\\(H_{a(n)}=\\emptyset^{(n)}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时算术层中的集合可判定，故可归约于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_1=\\emptyset\">\\(H_1=\\emptyset\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span> 时，Post 定理使每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> 集可归约于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset^{(n)}\">\\(\\emptyset^{(n)}\\)</span>；取补只需翻转判定输出，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n^0\">\\(\\Pi_n^0\\)</span> 集亦可归约于该层。最后使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HYP}\">\\(\\mathrm{HYP}\\)</span> 的定义，而不是把某集合误写为“属于一个跳跃集”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-hyperarithmetical","status":"resolved","id":"a8bec8cb4c1a4891","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-hyperarithmetical]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"ca39023cb294c484","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def","status":"resolved","id":"6587